{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Imgify 是一款結合格式轉換與水印功能的圖像處理應用，可在 JPEG、PNG、HEIC、HEIF、GIF、TIFF、BMP、ICO 與 PDF 等超過 11 種格式之間互相轉換，並支援批次加入文字或圖像水印。攝影師、設計師與內容創作者都適合使用。此應用原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>批次轉檔與水印一次完成</h2>\n<p>應用支援超過 11 種格式互換，涵蓋 JPEG、PNG、HEIC、GIF、TIFF、BMP、ICO 與 PDF，可批次處理多張圖片，並自訂壓縮品質、尺寸與比例。水印工具提供文字與圖像兩種模式，可調整字體、顏色與九種擺放位置，配合實時預覽確認效果。轉換期間會保留 EXIF 資料與透明背景，完成後可儲存至相片、檔案或直接分享。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-19-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-20-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-21-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-22-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-23-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1260x2736bb-19-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Imgify: Batch Image Converter</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T03:18:16.430504+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":391,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T02:57:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T08:37:42.910848+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"529ddb9bfa6480befdb3c0a4ec0b5354c88a4f043388e261368f76130ec3bd6c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}